./logs/iter_009_idea_02_explorer_01.stderr.log:2167:- Zhi Chen, Zhenyu Hu, Ruiqin Wang. "Screening with Limited Information: A Dual Perspective." *Operations Research* 72(4):1487-1504, 2024. DOI: https://doi.org/10.1287/opre.2022.0016. Relevance: robust screening and minimax pricing duality; adjacent to the LP-duality interpretation of the multi-threshold \(\kappa\) gap.
