./iterations/iter_004/idea_01/critic_01_on_explorer_01.md:35:   Luo-Schapire 2014 supports horizon-quantifier terminology, not this delayed market-making lower bound. Cesa-Bianchi et al. 2016 supports delayed-bandit minimax background, not the block proof directly.
